 request, but maybe you do not have the time to fix the bug yourself, so it's good enough to just open the issue and then someone else can use it as a starting point to write their pull request to fix it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3543936558/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3544164288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112892#issuecomment-3544164288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112892","id":3544164288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TP6fA","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T22:43:16Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T22:43:16Z","body":"Not only in this case, but all struct array properties do not correspond to class references. To fix this, the documentation functionality needs to be enhanced.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3544164288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3574664140","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112892#issuecomment-3574664140","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112892","id":3574664140,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VEQvM","user":{"login":"WarmBuns","id":15069763,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDY5NzYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15069763?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns","html_url":"https://github.com/WarmBuns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-25T09:32:19Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T09:58:26Z","body":"@TokageItLab Just so I am understanding correctly, supporting descriptions here would not be a simple PR adding the missing text? I had come here to report the same issue and open a PR\n\nDoes anyone know if there are existing enhancements out there for addressing this gap? (assuming I interpreted the above comments correctly)\n\nThank you!!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3574664140/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3575840638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112892#issuecomment-3575840638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112892","id":3575840638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VIv9-","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-25T14:08:59Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T14:18:08Z","body":"> Does anyone know if there are existing enhancements out there for addressing this gap?\n\nThat functionality is not yet available in Godot. To display document in the Inspector, we must bind the setter and getter to the member using the BIND_PROPERTY macro.\n\nHowever, currently, struct array properties cannot be bound using that macro; instead, they access the setter and getter through property path branching. In other words, for the struct array properties, only the setter and getter are documented in the class reference.\n\nIn this case, the property paths are hard-coded within each C++ class, such as `bones/<index>/name` or `bones_<index>_name`. This nesting style is left to the implementer's discretion, and no specific format is defined as Godot. So, if we wish to bind them like other members, we would need to provide some kind of macro to determine the nesting style. Furthermore, if we do so, we must be especially careful to avoid breaking compatibility.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3575840638/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3579119585","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112892#issuecomment-3579119585","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112892","id":3579119585,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VVQfh","user":{"login":"WarmBuns","id":15069763,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDY5NzYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15069763?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns","html_url":"https://github.com/WarmBuns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WarmBuns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-26T04:56:41Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T04:56:41Z","body":"Appreciate your detailed response thank you","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3579119585/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]